WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.480
The FBI has arrested almost 9,000 criminals in this year's crime sweep.

00:04.960 --> 00:09.640
Illegal crossings along the border have plummeted to the lowest level since 1970.

00:10.600 --> 00:13.580
Trump ran on keeping the borders and streets safe.

00:13.700 --> 00:16.760
It's the reason he boosted his turnout with blacks.

00:17.800 --> 00:23.700
For them to manipulate this now, to make it look like the troops are coming in to attack black people?

00:23.940 --> 00:24.260
No.

00:24.260 --> 00:27.620
They're coming in to do what we asked them to do.

00:27.620 --> 00:31.120
And that is to get these illegals out of our communities.

00:32.020 --> 00:34.520
Ribs is now going full tinfoil hat.

00:35.160 --> 00:39.640
J.B. Beck says if they don't stop this N-word, he's going to steal the midterms.

00:40.280 --> 00:47.040
I fear that what they're going to do is deploy these folks eventually to polling places

00:47.040 --> 00:49.360
and say they're protecting the vote.

00:49.360 --> 00:56.480
Do what he said he might do in 2020, which is use the military to confiscate the ballot boxes

00:56.480 --> 00:58.740
and count the votes.

00:59.540 --> 01:00.820
It's official.

01:01.640 --> 01:02.680
New hoax alert.

01:03.100 --> 01:04.240
New hoax alert.

01:04.780 --> 01:05.820
New hoax alert.

